Outpost Survival Game

Inspiration:
    - State of Decay 2
    - Warcraft 3
    - Age of Empires 2
    - Project Zomboid
    - Runescape
    - Battle Brothers

Core Systems:
    - Manage a town in a large world
    - Different base options across the map
    - Recruit characters to your outpost with different skills
    - Secure resources on the map to give your main base additional income
    - Destroy or befriend other settlers in the world
    - Simulated World Economy
    - Semi-idle game, player will want to grind their citizen's skill levels to maximize progression
        - This progression will take many hours of play time and a game could last for dozens or even hundreds of hours
    - Perma-death for citizens but many ways to minimize lethality

Enemies:
    - Aggressive and Powerful Wildlife
    - Enemy settlers

Setting:
    - Grim dark style fantasy
        - Mostly conventional medieval combat
        - Occasional powerful and terrifying magic

Base Control
    - Production Chain for commodities
    - Resources:
        - Lumber
            - Gathered at lumber camp
            - Lumber camp re-plants trees as well
            - Sustainable resource
        - Water
        - Food
        - Housing
        - Commodities
        - Gold
    - Import / Export
        - Difficult due to the danger of the world
        - Armed caravans needed
    - Defenses important
        - Random raids and sieges

Skill System:
    - Long grind to max out a skill
    - Skill for every type of combat and labor
    - Max total level achievable does not allow every skill to be maxed
    - Have to specialize

